    │                                                              │
    │  Update Mihari                                               │
    │                                                              │
    │  The installed build uses an unrecognized version label.     │
    │  Mihari cannot determine whether this is an upgrade or       │
    │  downgrade, or confirm data compatibility.                   │
    │                                                              │
    │  After confirmation                                          │
    │  Replace Mihari, synchronize and restart the installed       │
    │  service, verify its version, then reopen the TUI.           │
    │                                                              │
    │  This TUI closes after confirmation. If installation fails,  │
    │  reopen Mihari to retry.                                     │
    │  ↑/↓ PgUp/PgDn scroll · 11–20/20                             │
    │                                                              │
    │                                          Confirm    Cancel   │
    │  ←/→ Tab select · Enter accept · Esc cancel                  │
